OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FPlenty of sunshine around to
OL,6,Fstart on Wednesday. Still feeling
OL,7,Fmild, with cloud building through the
OL,8,Fmorning, thick enough for some rain
OL,9,Fover Cumbria by the afternoon. Very
OL,10,Fwindy with gales along exposed coasts
OL,11,Fand on hills.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRemaining very windy with
OL,14,Fgales this evening with some rain over
OL,15,Fthe hills, though largely dry. Cloud
OL,16,Fbuilding overnight with rain arriving
OL,17,Facross Cumbria by dawn. Mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
