OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FDry in the south initially
OL,6,Fbut turning cloudier and more
OL,7,Funsettled with a band of rain sinking
OL,8,Facross the region throughout the day.
OL,9,FMild with winds easing by the
OL,10,Fafternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FBreezy
OL,13,Fand colder on Friday with sunny spells
OL,14,Fand showers. Settled and largely dry
OL,15,Fthereafter with some sunshine and
OL,16,Fcold, locally frosty night with
OL,17,Flighter winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
